#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Test: Send invoice email with the REAL PDF (generated by WeasyPrint).

Flow:
  1. POST invoice data to the Python agent's /invoice/generate-pdf endpoint
  2. Agent generates the real PDF using WeasyPrint + Jinja2 invoice.html template
  3. We render the email HTML template with the same invoice data
  4. Send the email with the real PDF as attachment via Brevo
"""

